# cold-lava board WORKSPACE, with no file: the board picker in a loop of its own, with no menu
# behind it. It lists the workspace's boards and filters them as you type; a name that
# matches none makes a new board. The board then runs on its own: a card is typed and saved,
# and q ends the program. tests/drive.rs starts the subcommand and reads the new canvas after.
size 140x30
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
expect Eruptions Timeline.canvas
expect Volcano Venn.canvas
expect Welcome.canvas
expect + new board "Untitled.canvas"
expect-not cold-lava workspaces
screen
type venn
wait-for + new board "venn.canvas"
expect Volcano Venn.canvas
expect-not Welcome.canvas
keys backspace backspace backspace backspace
wait-for + new board "Untitled.canvas"
type Alone
wait-for + new board "Alone.canvas"
expect-not Welcome.canvas
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Alone · 0 cards
expect-not Ctrl-o
keys n
wait-for editing · type text · ⏎ new line · Esc done (saves)
type On its own
keys esc
wait-for whiteboard Alone · 1 cards
screen
keys q
exits 0
